// An interior blank is a space.
// A vertical tab does not glue two words.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE blank ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG blank law

IMPULSE blank 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "blank" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
